yle=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px;\">We cheer for victory!! Then we realize that the Chairman cannot flip (no underbosses in the trash). So we wait a couple rounds, mostly visionary and haka passing to get cards, Wrath playing more and more gadgets. Once the 2 prison breaks have been played, I kill the operative with the Savage Mana, flipping the operative in the process.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px;\"><strong>8-9th round</strong> (lost count): Operative flips, he heals himself (we laugh, we was full HP anyway), and the combo of Wrath&#39;s Inventory Barrage + My Haka of Battle kill him in one round.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px;\">In the end we were in our 20s HP, and most of the damage had been done by the environment. Boy, that was EASY!</span></p>",
