        "cooked": "<p>Haha, cool :). We kickced the Chairman's arse in a similar fashion once (not on Advanced Mode, though), when I played Haka and used Savage Mana. Fortunately I remembered after \"eating\" two Underbosses that I needed to leave three, so we killed those and let the Chairman flip (while I was busy eating Thugs) and <span class=\"bbcode-i\">then</span> I ate the Underbosses when they next came out. The Chairman, I think, basically got mashed by a massive load of overkill when I unleashed Savage Mana to finish the game (Operative had already been defeated earlier).</p>",
